# GTD_mindwtr — Cursor code-repo context

This is the **code** repo. Planning, BMAD docs, and architecture diagrams live
in the sibling repo `~/Projects/GTD_automation`. Read its
`.cursor/rules/00-gtd-automation.mdc` for the full project context (north star,
how to communicate with Sergey, deployment topology). This file covers only
code-level conventions specific to this repo.

## 1. What this repo is

A **hard fork of Mindwtr** (`dongdongbh/Mindwtr`, AGPL-3.0). It runs the GTD
engine + the AI Service that turns captures into proposals + the web UI + the
desktop capture agent. Upstream is pulled periodically; conflicts are managed
in `docker/cloud-prod/`.

```
apps/
  cloud/          mindwtr-cloud  — Bun HTTP server, task store, /v1/data sync,
                                   task-change webhook fan-out
  desktop/        mindwtr-app    — Vite + React + nginx, web UI (Inbox, Focus,
                                   AI Playbook View, RecordingBanner)
  ai-service/    Bun + Hono — Enricher / Proposer / Reviser / ProactiveRunner
                              / Memory module / Procedural pipeline /
                              RecordingDistiller / RoutingTarget / ThreadRegistry
  capture-agent/  Bun + Swift helpers — screens 30s + audio (Opus 32k) +
                                          active-window, posts to ai-service
                                          AGENT_ENDPOINT
  mobile/         Expo React Native — Mindwtr fork for iOS+Android (bundleId
                                       uk.kurdy.gtd.mindwtr via app.config.ts)
docker/           compose.yaml (dev), cloud-prod/ (production kit for makurdi)
packages/core/    @mindwtr/core — shared types, sync logic
```

